{"cache_key":"916f8bb27ab90772c0f37d5d97f55c50a3e4c57e1ef9c575f7a5c0c1aeffdbb9","segment_id":"xReplies.guests.hint","source_path":"extensions/x/src/i18n/locales/en.ts","src_lang":"en","text":"Applies to the selected X account. Guests get repository answers from its agent and hidden subagents. They can’t write, run commands, open visible sessions, or use other agents. Maintainers keep their normal access.","text_hash":"d2e78395b30ad1b38ec79b7fe09060bf68b5543e2a1af1c22227cce21210cc65","tgt_lang":"zh-TW","translated":"適用於所選的 X 帳號。訪客會從該帳號的代理程式及隱藏的子代理程式取得儲存庫相關解答。他們無法寫入、執行指令、開啟可見的工作階段或使用其他代理程式。維護者仍保有原有的存取權限。","updated_at":"2026-11-28T22:02:46.936Z"}
